      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "LTX-2.3 V2V Music Visual Patching Workflow\n\n=== PURPOSE ===\nFix bad AnimateDiff renders + add style for music visuals.\nNo lip-sync or characters — push denoise higher for dramatic restyling.\n\n=== VRAM ===\nTarget: 24GB (RTX 4090/3090)\nProfile: mid_vram_12_24gb (fp8 + distilled LoRA)\nAudio: DISABLED (bypass audio VAE nodes to save VRAM)\n\n=== TWO-PASS PIPELINE ===\nPass 1: 640x352, 8 steps, euler, linear_quadratic scheduler\n  → Base V2V generation from conditioned input\nPass 2: 1280x720, 3 steps, euler, ManualSigmas (0.85, 0.725, 0.4219, 0.0)\n  → Refine 2x-upscaled latent via LTXVLatentUpsampler\n\n=== IC-LORA STACK ===\n1. distilled_lora (strength 1.0) — REQUIRED for 8-step fast pipeline\n2. iclora_decompression (strength 0.7) — removes compression artifacts\n3. omninft_rl_lora (strength 2.0) — general quality boost (AV sync, prompt adherence)\n\n=== DENOISE GUIDE ===\n0.3-0.4 = Fix artifacts, keep motion (subtle patch)\n0.4-0.5 = Fix + light restyle (recommended default)\n0.5-0.7 = Moderate restyle (dramatic style change)\n0.7-1.0 = Full regeneration (source as ghost guide only)\n\n=== TO ADD STYLE ===\nOption A: Swap omninft_rl_lora for editanything_multitask\n  - Prompt: 'Convert the video into a <STYLE NAME> style.'\n  - Drop distilled_lora, raise CFG to 3-6, increase steps to 20-30\n  - 300+ trained style names\n\nOption B: Add iclora_day_to_night for mood/lighting change\n  - Stack alongside the fix LoRAs at strength 0.7-0.9\n  - Works with distilled pipeline (CFG 1.0)\n\n=== TO ADD BEAT-DRIVEN VISUALS ===\nAdd audio_reactive LoRA to the stack:\n  - Use scripts/analyze_beats.py to find beat cut points\n  - Cut footage at downbeats for rhythmically intentional segments\n  - Render per-beat segments with tuned audio_reactive strength\n\n=== OUTPUT ===\n1280x720 from this workflow.\nFor 1080p: add FlashVSR node after VAE decode (720p → 1080p).\nFlashVSR is not in the manifest — install manually from:\n  https://github.com/naxci1/ComfyUI-FlashVSR_Stable\n\n=== SEGMENT HANDLING ===\nMax 385 frames (~16s at 24fps) per generation.\nFor longer clips: chain segments (last frame → next first frame).\nClean chaining up to ~5 extensions before visible drift.\n\n=== REQUIRED MODELS ===\npython scripts/download_ltx23_models.py --ids \\\n  checkpoint_fp8 distilled_lora \\\n  iclora_decompression omninft_rl_lora \\\n  spatial_upscaler\n\n=== GATED REPOS ===\niclora_decompression is gated — visit:\n  https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Decompression\nClick 'Agree and Access', set HF_TOKEN before download."
      ],
